,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 155% of normal in March to April but only 56% in January to February. Grid 22670 had its driest year in 1953 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
